msgid "Babilim"
msgstr "Babilim"

#. Description of the plugin
#: babilim.php
msgid "Fills in missing translations for the plugins and themes already installed on your site."
msgstr "Lìonaidh e na h-eadar-theangachaidhean a tha a dhìth airson na plugain agus na cuspairean a tha stàlaichte air an làrach agad mar-thà."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:335
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:336
#: admin/class-babilim-translations-table.php:400
msgid "Translations"
msgstr "Eadar-theangachaidhean"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:343
msgid "Babilim Settings"
msgstr "Roghainnean Babilim"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:344
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2557
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2846
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Roghainnean"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:371
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:779
msgid "You are not allowed to do this."
msgstr "Chan eil cead agad seo a dhèanamh."

#. translators: 1: the most operations one run accepts, 2: how many were selected.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:400
#, php-format
msgid "Select fewer components: at most %1$d operations per run (you selected %2$d)."
msgstr "Tagh nas lugha de cho-phàirtean: %1$d gnìomhachd air a' char as motha gach ruith (thagh thu %2$d)."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:413
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1132
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1303
msgid "That component is not installed on this site, so a translation cannot be requested for it."
msgstr "Chan eil am pàirt sin air a stàladh air an làrach seo, agus mar sin chan urrainn eadar-theangachadh iarraidh air a shon."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:933
msgid "Already installed."
msgstr "Stàlaichte mar-thà."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:933
msgid "Downloaded and installed."
msgstr "Chaidh a luchdadh a-nuas agus a stàladh."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:956
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1297
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1373
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1951
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2115
#: includes/class-babilim-api-client.php:520
#: includes/class-babilim-site.php:311
#: includes/class-babilim-site.php:362
#: includes/class-babilim-site.php:705
#: includes/class-babilim-site.php:838
msgid "Babilim has not been enabled for this site yet."
msgstr "Chan eil Babilim air a chur an comas airson na làraich seo fhathast."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:975
msgid "No build is available to download for this locale."
msgstr "Chan eil togail ri fhaighinn airson a luchdadh a-nuas airson an sgeama ionadail seo."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1030
msgid "Rolled back to the previous build."
msgstr "Chaidh a thilleadh dhan build roimhe."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1089
msgid "Rolled back and reported."
msgstr "Chaidh a thilleadh agus aithris."

#. translators: %s: why sending the report failed.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1095
#, php-format
msgid "Rolled back, but the report could not be sent: %s"
msgstr "Chaidh a thilleadh, ach cha b' urrainnear an aithisg a chur: %s"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1119
msgid "Removed."
msgstr "Chaidh a thoirt air falbh."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1155
msgid "Translation requested."
msgstr "Chaidh eadar-theangachadh iarraidh."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1177
msgid "This component was already uploaded. Babilim is checking it now."
msgstr "Chaidh am pàirt seo a luchdadh suas mar-thà. Tha Babilim ga sgrùdadh an-dràsta."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1217
msgid "Upload cancelled."
msgstr "Chaidh an luchdadh suas a chur dheth."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1228
msgid "Upload complete — translation requested."
msgstr "Luchdadh suas deiseil — chaidh eadar-theangachadh iarraidh."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1306
msgid "This component does not declare a version number, so a translation cannot be requested for it."
msgstr "Chan eil am pàirt seo a’ cur an cèill àireamh tionndaidh, agus mar sin chan urrainn eadar-theangachadh iarraidh air a shon."

#. translators: %d: the most characters a version number may have.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1313
#, php-format
msgid "This component's version number is longer than %d characters, which Babilim cannot handle, so a translation cannot be requested for it."
msgstr "Tha àireamh tionndaidh a’ phàirt seo nas fhaide na %d caractar, rud nach urrainn do Babilim làimhseachadh, agus mar sin chan urrainn eadar-theangachadh iarraidh air a shon."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1319
msgid "A translation cannot be requested for that locale on this site right now."
msgstr "Chan urrainnear eadar-theangachadh iarraidh airson an locale sin air an làrach seo an-dràsta."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1345
msgid "Thank you. Your report was sent."
msgstr "Tapadh leibh. Chaidh an aithisg agad a chur."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1378
msgid "This report does not name a valid plugin or theme and locale."
msgstr "Chan eil an aithisg seo ag ainmeachadh plugan no cuspair agus locale dligheach."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1382
msgid "Please choose a category for this report."
msgstr "Tagh roinn-seòrsa airson na h-aithisge seo."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1386
msgid "This report is missing a valid build to report against."
msgstr "Chan eil build dligheach aig an aithisg seo airson aithris a dhèanamh air."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1389
msgid "This build is not one this site currently knows about for this component/locale."
msgstr "Chan e build a tha an làrach seo a’ aithneachadh an-dràsta airson a’ phàirt/ionadail seo a th’ ann."

#. translators: 1: the name of a form field, 2: how many characters it has, 3: the most characters it may have.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1441
#, php-format
msgid "The field \"%1$s\" is too long: it has %2$d characters and the limit is %3$d. Nothing was sent; please shorten it and try again."
msgstr "Tha an raon \"%1$s\" ro fhada: tha %2$d caractar ann agus is e %3$d a' chrìoch. Cha deach dad a chur; giorraich e agus feuch ris a-rithist."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1466
msgid "Original string"
msgstr "An sreang thùsail"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1470
msgid "String context"
msgstr "Co-theacsa an t-sreang"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1474
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:4067
msgid "Current translation"
msgstr "An t-eadar-theangachadh làithreach"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1478
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:4069
msgid "Suggested translation"
msgstr "Eadar-theangachadh molta"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1482
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:4071
msgid "Note (optional)"
msgstr "Nòta (roghainneil)"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1486
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:4073
msgid "Where you saw this (optional)"
msgstr "Càite am faca tu seo (roghainneil)"

#. translators: %s: the date and time syncing is expected to resume.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1549
#, php-format
msgid "Babilim sync is temporarily delayed by the service (rate limited); it will try again after %s."
msgstr "Tha sioncronachadh Babilim air a chuingealachadh rè ùine leis an t-seirbheis (cuingealachadh ìre); feuchaidh e a-rithist às dèidh %s."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1583
msgid "That is not a valid WordPress locale code. Nothing was saved."
msgstr "Chan e còd ionadail WordPress dligheach a tha sin. Cha deach dad a shàbhaladh."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1616
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "Chaidh na roghainnean a shàbhaladh."

#. translators: %s: Babilim support email address. Do not translate or change it.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1678
#, php-format
msgid "If this is on, uninstalling also erases this site's identity. The paid license attached to this site cannot be restored automatically afterwards; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s to get it back."
msgstr "Ma tha seo air, sguabaidh dì-stàladh às dearbh-aithne na làraich seo cuideachd. Chan urrainn dhuinn an cead-cleachdaidh pàighte a tha ceangailte ris an làrach seo aiseag gu fèin-obrachail às dèidh sin; dh’fheumadh tu fios a chur gu taic Babilim aig %s gus a faighinn air ais."

#. translators: %s: Babilim support email address. Do not translate or change it.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1694
#, php-format
msgid "Babilim is set to erase this site's identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to this site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick \"Delete all Babilim data on uninstall\" in the Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?"
msgstr "Tha Babilim air a shuidheachadh gus dearbh-aithne na làraich seo a sguabadh às nuair a thèid am plugan a sguabadh às. Chan urrainnear an cead-cleachdaidh pàighte a tha ceangailte ris an làrach seo aiseag gu fèin-obrachail an uairsin; dh’fheumadh tu fios a chur gu taic Babilim aig %s. Gus an dearbh-aithne a chumail, briog air Sguir dheth, thoir an tic far “Sguab às a h-uile dàta Babilim nuair a thèid a dhì-stàladh” ann an Roghainnean Babilim, agus dì-ghnìomhaich a-rithist. A bheil thu airson a dhì-ghnìomhachadh co-dhiù?"

#. translators: 1: number of sites on the network that erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. 2: Babilim support email address. Do not translate or change it.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1719
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d site on this network is set to erase its Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to that site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %2$s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick \"Delete all Babilim data on uninstall\" in that site's Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?"
msgid_plural "%1$d sites on this network are set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to those sites could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %2$s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick \"Delete all Babilim data on uninstall\" in each site's Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?"
msgstr[0] "Tha %1$d làrach air an lìonra seo air a suidheachadh gus an dearbh-aithne Babilim aice a sguabadh às nuair a thèid am plugan a sguabadh às. Chan urrainnear an cead-cleachdaidh pàighte a tha ceangailte ris an làrach sin aiseag gu fèin-obrachail an uairsin; dh’fheumadh tu fios a chur gu taic Babilim aig %2$s. Gus an dearbh-aithne a chumail, briog air Sguir dheth, thoir an tic far “Sguab às a h-uile dàta Babilim nuair a thèid a dhì-stàladh” ann an Roghainnean Babilim na làraich sin, agus dì-ghnìomhaich a-rithist. A bheil thu airson a dhì-ghnìomhachadh co-dhiù?"
msgstr[1] "Tha %1$d làrach air an lìonra seo air an suidheachadh gus an dearbh-aithne Babilim aca a sguabadh às nuair a thèid am plugan a sguabadh às. Chan urrainnear an cead-cleachdaidh pàighte a tha ceangailte ris na làraichean sin aiseag gu fèin-obrachail an uairsin; dh’fheumadh tu fios a chur gu taic Babilim aig %2$s. Gus na dearbh-aithnean a chumail, briog air Sguir dheth, thoir an tic far “Sguab às a h-uile dàta Babilim nuair a thèid a dhì-stàladh” ann an Roghainnean Babilim gach làraich, agus dì-ghnìomhaich a-rithist. A bheil thu airson a dhì-ghnìomhachadh co-dhiù?"
msgstr[2] "Tha %1$d làrach air an lìonra seo air an suidheachadh gus an dearbh-aithne Babilim aca a sguabadh às nuair a thèid am plugan a sguabadh às. Chan urrainnear an cead-cleachdaidh pàighte a tha ceangailte ris na làraichean sin aiseag gu fèin-obrachail an uairsin; dh’fheumadh tu fios a chur gu taic Babilim aig %2$s. Gus na dearbh-aithnean a chumail, briog air Sguir dheth, thoir an tic far “Sguab às a h-uile dàta Babilim nuair a thèid a dhì-stàladh” ann an Roghainnean Babilim gach làraich, agus dì-ghnìomhaich a-rithist. A bheil thu airson a dhì-ghnìomhachadh co-dhiù?"
msgstr[3] "Tha %1$d làrach air an lìonra seo air an suidheachadh gus an dearbh-aithne Babilim aca a sguabadh às nuair a thèid am plugan a sguabadh às. Chan urrainnear an cead-cleachdaidh pàighte a tha ceangailte ris na làraichean sin aiseag gu fèin-obrachail an uairsin; dh’fheumadh tu fios a chur gu taic Babilim aig %2$s. Gus na dearbh-aithnean a chumail, briog air Sguir dheth, thoir an tic far “Sguab às a h-uile dàta Babilim nuair a thèid a dhì-stàladh” ann an Roghainnean Babilim gach làraich, agus dì-ghnìomhaich a-rithist. A bheil thu airson a dhì-ghnìomhachadh co-dhiù?"

#. translators: %s: Babilim support email address. Do not translate or change it.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1738
#, php-format
msgid "This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick \"Delete all Babilim data on uninstall\" in each site's Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?"
msgstr "Tha cus làraichean air an lìonra seo airson an sgrùdadh fa leth, agus dh’fhaodadh gu bheil cuid dhiubh air an suidheachadh gus an dearbh-aithne Babilim aca a sguabadh às nuair a thèid am plugan a sguabadh às. Chan urrainnear an cead-cleachdaidh pàighte a tha ceangailte ri làrach den leithid aiseag gu fèin-obrachail an uairsin; dh’fheumadh tu fios a chur gu taic Babilim aig %s. Gus na dearbh-aithnean a chumail, briog air Sguir dheth, thoir an tic far “Sguab às a h-uile dàta Babilim nuair a thèid a dhì-stàladh” ann an Roghainnean Babilim gach làraich, agus dì-ghnìomhaich a-rithist. A bheil thu airson a dhì-ghnìomhachadh co-dhiù?"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1827
msgid "Open Babilim settings"
msgstr "Fosgail Roghainnean Babilim"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1832
msgid "Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed."
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn do Babilim an làrach seo a dhearbhadh, mar sin cha deach dad a luchdadh a-nuas no a stàladh."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1844
msgid "The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge."
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn don t-seirbheis ruigsinn air an làrach agad. Tha e coltach gu bheil balla-teine, plugan tèarainteachd no riaghailt aig an òstair a' bacadh na h-iarrtais; ceadaich iarrtasan gu /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1846
msgid "Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded."
msgstr "Thug an làrach agad ro fhada gus freagairt. Feuch ris a-rithist an ceann greis, agus dèan cinnteach nach eil an t-òstair ro slaodach no ro thrang."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1848
msgid "Your site answered, but not with what was expected. The REST API may be rewritten by another plugin, or that endpoint may be cached; please exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting."
msgstr "Fhreagair an làrach agad, ach chan ann leis na bha dùil. Dh'fhaodadh gu bheil plugan eile ag ath-sgrìobhadh an REST API, no gu bheil an endpoint sin air a thasgadh; fàg /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge a-mach à tasgadh agus ath-sgrìobhadh."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1850
msgid "Please check that your site can be reached from the internet, then try again."
msgstr "Dèan cinnteach gun gabh an làrach agad ruigsinn on eadar-lìon, agus feuch ris a-rithist."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1873
msgid "Re-verify"
msgstr "Dearbh a-rithist"

#. translators: 1: number of components left out, 2: number of locales left out.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1894
#, php-format
msgid "This site is over the size the service accepts in one sync, so some items were left out: %1$d components and %2$d locales."
msgstr "Tha an làrach seo nas motha na na ghabhas an t-seirbheis ann an aon sioncronachadh, agus mar sin chaidh cuid de nithean fhàgail a-mach: %1$d co-phàirtean agus %2$d locales."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1923
msgid "This site is verified."
msgstr "Tha an làrach seo dearbhte."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1936
msgid "Registration restarted."
msgstr "Chaidh an clàradh ath-thòiseachadh."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1957
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2031
msgid "Sync complete."
msgstr "Tha an sioncronachadh deiseil."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1992
msgid "Babilim is enabling and checking this site… Reload this page or wait for the scheduled check to finish."
msgstr "Tha Babilim ga chur an comas agus a' sgrùdadh na làraich seo… Ath-luchdaich an duilleag seo no fuirich gus am bi an sgrùdadh clàraichte deiseil."

#. translators: 1: short name of the step that failed, 2: the message for that failure.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1997
#, php-format
msgid "Babilim could not finish enabling (%1$s): %2$s"
msgstr "Cha b' urrainn do Babilim crìoch a chur air a chur an comas (%1$s): %2$s"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2002
msgid "A host that serves only one PHP request at a time cannot complete this step."
msgstr "Chan urrainn do dh'òstair nach obraich ach aon iarrtas PHP aig an aon àm an ceum seo a choileanadh."

#. translators: %d: number of components found on this site.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2023
#, php-format
msgid "Babilim is enabled: this site is verified and %d component was found."
msgid_plural "Babilim is enabled: this site is verified and %d components were found."
msgstr[0] "Tha Babilim an comas: tha an làrach seo dearbhte agus chaidh %d phàirt a lorg."
msgstr[1] "Tha Babilim an comas: tha an làrach seo dearbhte agus chaidh %d phàirt a lorg."
msgstr[2] "Tha Babilim an comas: tha an làrach seo dearbhte agus chaidh %d pàirtean a lorg."
msgstr[3] "Tha Babilim an comas: tha an làrach seo dearbhte agus chaidh %d pàirt a lorg."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2107
msgid "Babilim is disabled. Nothing more is sent; translations already installed keep working."
msgstr "Tha Babilim à comas. Chan eil dad eile ga chur; bidh na h-eadar-theangachaidhean a chaidh a stàladh mu thràth ag obair fhathast."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2129
msgid "Supplementary translation index rebuilt."
msgstr "Chaidh clàr-amais eadar-theangachaidh leasachail ath-thogail."

#. translators: %d: number of files deleted by this sweep.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2147
#, php-format
msgid "Sweep complete: %d file deleted."
msgid_plural "Sweep complete: %d files deleted."
msgstr[0] "Sguabadh deiseil: chaidh %d fhaidhle a sguabadh às."
msgstr[1] "Sguabadh deiseil: chaidh %d fhaidhle a sguabadh às."
msgstr[2] "Sguabadh deiseil: chaidh %d faidhlichean a sguabadh às."
msgstr[3] "Sguabadh deiseil: chaidh %d faidhle a sguabadh às."

#. translators: %d: number of components removed.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2179
#, php-format
msgid "Removed %d installed component."
msgid_plural "Removed %d installed components."
msgstr[0] "Chaidh %d phàirt stàlaichte a thoirt air falbh."
msgstr[1] "Chaidh %d phàirt stàlaichte a thoirt air falbh."
msgstr[2] "Chaidh %d pàirtean stàlaichte a thoirt air falbh."
msgstr[3] "Chaidh %d pàirt stàlaichte a thoirt air falbh."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2181
msgid "Automatic installs are now off; turn them on again in the settings if you want them."
msgstr "Tha stàlaidhean fèin-obrachail dheth a-nis; cuir air a-rithist iad sna roghainnean ma tha thu gam miannachadh."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2502
msgid "Babilim finds the plugins and themes on this site that have no translation for your language and installs one for each."
msgstr "Lorgaidh Babilim na plugain agus na h-ùrlaran air an làrach seo aig nach eil eadar-theangachadh don chànan agad agus stàlaichidh e eadar-theangachadh airson gach fear dhiubh."

#. translators: %s: a list of language names, joined the way the language joins lists.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2510
#, php-format
msgid "Languages found on this site: %s."
msgstr "Cànanan a chaidh a lorg air an làrach seo: %s."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2515
msgid "Available translations can be installed with one click, and missing ones can be requested. After that, new translations and updates are installed automatically (on the free plan, only for plugins and themes that already use a free slot)."
msgstr "Gabhaidh eadar-theangachaidhean a tha ri fhaighinn a stàladh le aon bhriogadh, agus gabhaidh feadhainn a tha a dhìth iarraidh. Às dèidh sin, thèid eadar-theangachaidhean ùra agus ùrachaidhean a stàladh gu fèin-obrachail (air a’ phlana an-asgaidh, dìreach airson plugain agus ùrlaran a tha a’ cleachdadh slot an-asgaidh mar-thà)."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2516
msgid "The free plan covers a limited number of plugins and themes; your exact quota is shown in Settings after you enable Babilim."
msgstr "Tha am plana an-asgaidh a’ còmhdach àireamh chuingealaichte de phlugain agus de dh’ùrlaran; tha do cheart chuota ri fhaicinn ann an Roghainnean às dèidh dhut Babilim a chur an comas."

